<title>POLAND: Ocean Q1 net rises to PLN 0.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Ocean Q1 net rises to PLN 0.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ocean preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 0.82 vs	0.40</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   0.51 vs	0.43</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.29 vs	0.24</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Ocean SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				  7.89 vs	6.07</p>
<p>    costs of sales			   5.25 vs	4.09</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.02 loss</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.21 vs	0.19</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.60 vs	2.52</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.91 vs	2.46</p>
<p>    investment				 0.44 vs	0.25</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
